   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Burkina Faso 2005-2009</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Burkina Faso 2005-2009</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Doktorandutbildning med &quot;sandwich model&quot; (f&#xe4;ltarbete i Burkina och kurser i Sverige) med examinering vid svenska universitet. &#xc4;ven st&#xf6;d till IT b&#xe5;de infrastruktur och utbildning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">University training with a &quot;sandwich model&quot; (fieldwork in Burkina and PhD courses in Sweden) with examination at Swedish Universities. Also support to ICT both with regard to infrastructure and training.</narrative>
  </description>
